### Create transaction (status NEW, filled later by the matching job)
POST {{host}}/api/transaction/v1/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer //Paste authorization header content (Bearer token) here

{
  "type": "PURCHASE",
  "stockTicker": "AAPL",
  "price": 173.00,
  "quantity": 10
}

### Get all transactions of the logged in user, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/transaction/v1
Authorization: Bearer //Paste authorization header content (Bearer token) here

### Get one transaction
GET {{host}}/api/transaction/v1/1
Authorization: Bearer //Paste authorization header content (Bearer token) here

### Cancel transaction (only NEW or PARTIALLY_FILLED)
POST {{host}}/api/transaction/v1/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer //Paste authorization header content (Bearer token) here

### Modify transaction (cancel and replace, returns the new transaction)
PUT {{host}}/api/transaction/v1/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer //Paste authorization header content (Bearer token) here

{
  "price": 170.00,
  "quantity": 5
}
